// Buildings around the core: each has levels, and each level is built by a builder in
// `minutes` (0 = at once), costs `cost`, adds `upkeep` per hour, and gives `effects`.
// Effects are the TOTAL at that level (not added to the level below). `minTier` on a level:
// the base tier needed to build that level; `unlockTier`: needed for level 1.
// Names and one-line descriptions are in the locale (`building.{id}.name` / `.blurb`); the
// effect lines are generated from `effects` (`effect.*` keys).
//
// Effects: rates (% more of a resource), allRates (% more of everything), flat (per hour,
// whatever the tool), cap (room for every resource), fuelPer100Ore (less furnace fuel),
// smeltPercent (faster furnaces), craftPercent (faster crafting), haulMinutes (bigger daily
// node haul), barrelLifeMinutes (barrels stay longer), barrelEveryMinutes (barrels come
// sooner), graceHours (longer before unpaid upkeep costs a level), workbench (crafting level),
// furnace (furnace type, 1 = the first in furnaces.json5).
{
  buildings: [
    {
      id: "workbench", unlockTier: "twig",
      levels: [
        { cost: { timber: 500, stone: 100 }, minutes: 0, upkeep: {}, effects: { workbench: 1 } },
        { minTier: "stone", cost: { timber: 1000, ingots: 500 }, minutes: 30, upkeep: {}, effects: { workbench: 2 } },
        { minTier: "metal", cost: { ingots: 3000, fuel: 20 }, minutes: 120, upkeep: {}, effects: { workbench: 3 } },
      ],
    },
